{"text":"purananuru","n":86,"lines":["சிற்றில் நற்றூண் பற்றி நின்மகன்","யாண்டு உளன் ஆயினும் அறியேன் ஓரும்","புலி சேர்ந்து போகிய கல்அளை போல","ஈன்ற வயிறோ இதுவே","தோன்றுவன் மாதோ போர்க்களத் தானே"],"tr":["ciṟṟil naṟṟūṇ paṟṟi niṉmakaṉ","yāṇṭu uḷaṉ āyiṉum aṟiyēṉ ōrum","puli cērntu pōkiya kalaḷai pōla","īṉṟa vayiṟō ituvē","tōṉṟuvaṉ mātō pōrkkaḷat tāṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"vākai","tinai_ta":"வாகை","turai_ta":"ஏறாண் முல்லை","poet_ta":"காவற் பெண்டு காதற்பெண்டு எனவும் பாடம்","poet_tr":"Kāvaṟ Peṇṭu Kātaṟpeṇṭu Eṉavum Pāṭam"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 19"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 10, āciriyattaḷai 8"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"சிற்றில்","tr":"ciṟṟil","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சிற்","tr":"ciṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றில்","tr":"ṟil"}]},{"text":"நற்றூண்","tr":"naṟṟūṇ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நற்","tr":"naṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றூண்","tr":"ṟūṇ"}]},{"text":"பற்றி","tr":"paṟṟi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பற்","tr":"paṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றி","tr":"ṟi"}]},{"text":"நின்மகன்","tr":"niṉmakaṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நின்","tr":"niṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மகன்","tr":"makaṉ"}]}],[{"text":"யாண்டுள","tr":"yāṇṭuḷa","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யாண்","tr":"yāṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுள","tr":"ṭuḷa"}]},{"text":"னாயினு","tr":"ṉāyiṉu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னா","tr":"ṉā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினு","tr":"yiṉu"}]},{"text":"மறியே","tr":"maṟiyē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மறி","tr":"maṟi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]},{"text":"னோரும்","tr":"ṉōrum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னோ","tr":"ṉō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரும்","tr":"rum"}]}],[{"text":"புலிசேர்ந்","tr":"pulicērn","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புலி","tr":"puli"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சேர்ந்","tr":"cērn"}]},{"text":"துபோகிய","tr":"tupōkiya","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துபோ","tr":"tupō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிய","tr":"kiya"}]},{"text":"கல்லளை","tr":"kallaḷai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கல்","tr":"kal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லளை","tr":"laḷai"}]},{"text":"போல","tr":"pōla","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ல","tr":"la"}]}],[{"text":"வீன்ற","tr":"vīṉṟa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வீன்","tr":"vīṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ற","tr":"ṟa"}]},{"text":"வயிறோ","tr":"vayiṟō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வயி","tr":"vayi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றோ","tr":"ṟō"}]},{"text":"விதுவே","tr":"vituvē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விது","tr":"vitu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}],[{"text":"தோன்றுவன்","tr":"tōṉṟuvaṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோன்","tr":"tōṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுவன்","tr":"ṟuvaṉ"}]},{"text":"மாதோ","tr":"mātō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"}]},{"text":"போர்க்களத்","tr":"pōrkkaḷat","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போர்க்","tr":"pōrk"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"களத்","tr":"kaḷat"}]},{"text":"தானே","tr":"tāṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"சிற்றில்","parts":[{"text":"சிற்றில்","lemma":"சிற்றில்","gloss":"small house"}],"gloss":"small house","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நற்றூண்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"good"},{"text":"தூண்","lemma":"தூண்","gloss":"pillar"}],"gloss":"fine pillar"},{"surface":"பற்றி","parts":[{"text":"பற்று","lemma":"பற்று","gloss":"grasp"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having (verbal participle suffix)"}],"gloss":"clutching"},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"your (oblique)"}],"gloss":"your"},{"surface":"மகன்","parts":[{"text":"மகன்","lemma":"மகன்","gloss":"son"}],"gloss":"son"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யாண்டு","parts":[{"text":"யாண்டு","lemma":"யாண்டு","gloss":"where"}],"gloss":"where"},{"surface":"உளன்","parts":[{"text":"உள்","lemma":"உள்","gloss":"be"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"he (masculine singular suffix)"}],"gloss":"he is"},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"ஆயின்","gloss":"if it is so"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even/although"}],"gloss":"yet"},{"surface":"அறியேன்","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"know"},{"text":"ஏன்","lemma":"ஏன்","gloss":"I (negative first-person singular suffix)"}],"gloss":"I do not know"},{"surface":"ஓரும்","parts":[{"text":"ஓரும்","lemma":"ஓரும்","gloss":"particle of contemplation"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புலி","parts":[{"text":"புலி","lemma":"புலி","gloss":"tiger"}],"gloss":"tiger"},{"surface":"சேர்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"சேர்","lemma":"சேர்","gloss":"join/occupy"},{"text":"ந்து","lemma":"ந்து","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having stayed"},{"surface":"போகிய","parts":[{"text":"போகு","lemma":"போகு","gloss":"go"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"இய","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"that left"},{"surface":"கல்","parts":[{"text":"கல்","lemma":"கல்","gloss":"stone"}],"gloss":"stone"},{"surface":"அளை","parts":[{"text":"அளை","lemma":"அளை","gloss":"cave"}],"gloss":"cave"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல்","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"resemble"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஈன்ற","parts":[{"text":"ஈன்","lemma":"ஈன்","gloss":"give birth"},{"text":"ற்","lemma":"ற்","gloss":"past tense infix"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"that gave birth to"},{"surface":"வயிறோ","parts":[{"text":"வயிறு","lemma":"வயிறு","gloss":"womb"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"interrogative/emphatic clitic"}],"gloss":"the womb?"},{"surface":"இதுவே","parts":[{"text":"இது","lemma":"இது","gloss":"this"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic clitic"}],"gloss":"this indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தோன்றுவன்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்று","lemma":"தோன்று","gloss":"appear"},{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"future tense infix"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"he (third-person masculine singular suffix)"}],"gloss":"he will appear"},{"surface":"மாதோ","parts":[{"text":"மாதோ","lemma":"மாதோ","gloss":"emphatic particle"}],"gloss":"surely"},{"surface":"போர்க்களத்து","parts":[{"text":"போர்க்களத்து","lemma":"போர்க்களத்து","gloss":"battlefield"}],"gloss":"battlefield","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஆனே","parts":[{"text":"ஆன்","lemma":"ஆன்","gloss":"locative suffix"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic clitic"}],"gloss":"on / indeed"}]}],"literal":"In my small house, clutching the fine pillar, your son / where he is, even if you ask, I do not know, indeed, / like a stone cave that a tiger stayed in and left, / the womb that gave birth to him is this indeed, / he will appear surely on the battlefield.","translation":"Clutching the elegant pillar of my small house, you ask, 'Where is your son?' I do not know where he is. But look at this womb that gave birth to him—it is like a stone cave once occupied and then abandoned by a tiger. He will surely be found on the battlefield!","modern":"என் சிறிய வீட்டின் அழகிய தூணைப் பற்றிக்கொண்டு, 'உன் மகன் எங்கே?' என்று கேட்கிறாய். அவன் எங்கு இருக்கிறான் என்று எனக்குத் தெரியாது. ஆனால், அவனைப் பெற்றெடுத்த என் வயிறு இதோ இருக்கிறது; இது புலி தங்கிவிட்டுச் சென்ற கற்குகையைப் போன்றது. அவன் போர்க்களத்தில்தான் இருப்பான்; அங்கே அவனைக் காணலாம்.","explanation":"A mother is speaking to a visitor who has come to her small home inquiring about the whereabouts of her young son. She replies that she does not know where he is at this moment, but proudly points to her own womb, comparing it to a rocky mountain cave from which a tiger has departed. This powerful metaphor implies that her son is a fierce tiger who has grown up and gone out to perform his heroic duty. The poem belongs to the vākai tiṇai (victory and heroism), specifically the theme of ēṟāṇ mullai, which celebrates the courage and martial pride of a warrior's mother. Key words that carry this heroic sentiment include 'புலி' (tiger), 'கல்அளை' (stone cave), and 'போர்க்களத்து' (battlefield).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.7],[1.7,2.9],[2.9,3.1],[3.1,3.2],[3.2,3.6],[3.6,4.1],[4.1,4.9],[4.9,5.2],[5.2,5.4],[5.4,6.0],[6.0,6.1],[6.4,7.3],[7.3,7.4],[7.6,8.0],[8.0,8.9],[8.9,9.0],[9.0,9.8],[9.8,9.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.8],[1.8,3.1],[3.1,3.4],[3.4,3.5],[3.5,3.9],[3.9,4.4],[4.4,5.4],[5.4,5.7],[5.7,5.8],[5.8,6.5],[6.5,6.7],[6.91,7.34],[7.77,7.99],[8.2,8.8],[8.8,9.8],[9.8,9.9],[9.9,10.8],[10.8,10.9]]},"sync":[[["சிற்றில்","small house"]],[["நற்றூண்","fine pillar"]],[["பற்றி","clutching"]],[["நின்","your"],["மகன்","son"]],[["யாண்டு","where"]],[["உளன்","he is"]],[["ஆயினும்","yet"]],[["அறியேன்","I do not know"]],[["ஓரும்","indeed"]],[["புலி","tiger"]],[["சேர்ந்து","having stayed"]],[["போகிய","that left"]],[["கல்","stone"],["அளை","cave"]],[["போல","like"]],[["ஈன்ற","that gave birth to"]],[["வயிறோ","the womb?"]],[["இதுவே","this indeed"]],[["தோன்றுவன்","he will appear"]],[["மாதோ","surely"]],[["போர்க்களத்து","battlefield"]],[["போர்க்களத்து","battlefield"],["ஆனே","on / indeed"]]]}